# The Starving (adoulin 84), the kinds: a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin with Hunger Strikes completed (a GM), the
# Timer 0 and 125 Adoulin fame (level 3: his script offers Always More Quoth the Ravenous, 3010, on its turns).
# Westerly Breeze: 3005 (a progressEvent: it outranks his script), finished: begun; available again (a GM): 3005 again
# (an event would give his script this turn: 3010). Accepted: 3006 (an event: the accepted section registered under
# Western Adoulin, user ruling 2026-11-04, kept Lua bugs), then his script's turn: 3010, finished: Always More Quoth
# the Ravenous begun (his script).
lists WesternAdoulin/Westerly_Breeze/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/3005
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=63.5,32,123 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Adoulin.HungerStrikes completed
fame Adoulin 125
login
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # available: 3005
finish                                  # begun
quest Adoulin.TheStarving available     # a GM
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # available: 3005 (a progressEvent, not his script's turn)
finish                                  # begun
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # accepted: 3006 (an event)
finish-if-event
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # his script's turn: 3010
finish                                  # Always More Quoth the Ravenous begun
